Create web application for writing plot using AI from providers like openrouter others.

Priority: simple interface and simple use

Main functions:
1) Multiple storychats, user could switch between them, delete them, rename and etc.
2) Simple customising AI parametrs(including thinking mode, level of thinking, maximum output tokens and other parametrs, that can be customized for llm from providers like openrouter)
3) Customized instructions prompt for llm(for turning simple llm in AI writer)
4) Plot components, part of text that give AI additional information for story context
5) Ability to change previous text before sending it to AI
6) Continue button, that send to llm story text and other information(llm will continue story)

Application should be writter assistant tool, that let user write and change text, and use llm to continue text using AI
